---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeading from '../../components/PageHeading.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact Ula" description="Share a destination suggestion, website feedback or a collaboration idea with the Ula travel design project.">
<PageHeading label="A CONVERSATION STARTS SOMEWHERE" title="Say vanakkam." description="A place we should explore, a detail we could improve, or an idea for something together. Leave a little note."/>
<section class="contact-layout wrap"><aside class="contact-intro"><h2>Good journeys<br/>begin with a hello.</h2><p>Ula is a personal portfolio project about discovering Tamil Nadu. This contact form lets you prepare and download a message.</p><p class="contact-note">Message delivery is not connected yet. Your note stays in this browser until you choose to save the file.</p><div class="contact-help"><span class="meta">EMAIL</span><p><span class="contact-email">hello@ula.example</span><br/><small>Placeholder address for this demo.</small></p><span class="meta">PLANNING A VISIT?</span><p>Start with our practical notes or create a personal trip brief.</p><a class="text-link" href="/travel-guide/">Explore the travel guide</a><button class="text-link" data-plan>Make a trip brief</button></div></aside><noscript><p>The message download needs JavaScript. You can continue browsing Ula using the navigation.</p></noscript><form id="contact-form" class="contact-form"><div class="contact-form-row"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" placeholder="How should we call you?"/></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200" placeholder="you@example.com"/></label></div><label>What's on your mind?<select name="topic"><option>Website feedback</option><option>Suggest a destination</option><option>Collaboration idea</option><option>Something else</option></select></label><label>Your message<textarea name="message" rows="6" required minlength="10" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Tell us a little more…"></textarea></label><p class="small">Your details are used only to create the message file. <a href="/privacy/">Read our privacy notes</a>.</p><button class="button" type="submit"><span>Save my message</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button><p id="contact-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section>
</Base>
